@startuml Physics_7Pass_Data_Flow
skinparam linetype ortho

title 13-Pass Physics Loop — per tick (deterministic order)

rectangle "Part[]\nArray[Part]" as PARTS

note bottom of PARTS
  All 13 passes operate on the same parts[] array
  Order is STRICT — pass N sees results of pass N-1
  3 constraint iterations enforce rope/rod limits
end note

rectangle "Pass 0: State Counters\nadvance_state for all is_moving\nsub_counter countdown, RNG delay\nwrap at state_limit_upper" as P0
rectangle "Pass 1: Gravity Integration\ntick per is_moving\nvel_y += gravity_y\npos += vel shift_9" as P1
rectangle "Pass 2: Behaviors\nDRIVER torque, LINK rope\nCONSUMER powered state" as P2
rectangle "Pass 3: Belts\nsync angular_velocity\nbelt_driver to slave" as P3
rectangle "Pass 4: Pressure Fields\nCONSUMER powered to\npressure field falloff" as P4
rectangle "Pass 5: Wall Constraints\nFloor bounce COR\nCeiling / left / right walls" as P5
rectangle "Pass 6: Collisions\nCELL=64 grid, AABB overlap\nPush-apart + COR impulse\non_collision to SOLVE.RES" as P6
rectangle "Pass 7: Proximity Triggers\ntriggers.has proximity\nwithin 80px" as P7
rectangle "Pass 8: Emitters/Consumers\nEMITTER powered to\nCONSUMER powered" as P8
rectangle "Pass 9: Electrical\noutlets clear/rebuild\nplugged consumers powered" as P9
rectangle "Pass 10: Flame/Ignition\nflame state over 1 + flammable\nwithin 40px to state=2" as P10
rectangle "Pass 11: Remove Destroyed\nparts with destroyed==true\nremoved from parts[]" as P11
rectangle "Pass 12-14: Rope x3\nCONSTRAINT_ITERATIONS=3\nLINK enforce rope length" as P12

PARTS -down-> P0
P0 -down-> P1
P1 -down-> P2
P2 -down-> P3
P3 -down-> P4
P4 -down-> P5
P5 -down-> P6
P6 -down-> P7
P7 -down-> P8
P8 -down-> P9
P9 -down-> P10
P10 -down-> P11
P11 -down-> P12

@enduml
